# Documentation and test files are tracked. The three blanket rules above are inherited
# from the upstream template and would hide both without a warning; check any other new
# file with `git check-ignore -v <path>`.
!docs/*.md
!docs/**/*.md
!**/*.test.ts
!**/*.spec.ts
